          "char_ge_yao"
        ]
      },
      {
        "text": "Ge tribe leader gives the tribe’s only rank five hints and clues Gu to Fang Yuan as apology after Ge Guang’s suspicion fails, and Fang Yuan accepts it after refusing several times. That gift is his second rank five Gu in northern plains.",
